    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Escape to the charming beach town of Inlet Beach for a family friendly getaway. Enjoy proximity to one of the most beautiful white sand beaches with clear emerald waters, located in a serene residential neighborhood close to Rosemary Beach. Indulge in relaxation or explore new activities. Shopping, dining, and entertainment within walking distance. Our beach access includes restrooms, an artificial reef for snorkeling, free parking, chair and umbrella rentals, and a lifeguard during peak season.<br><br>Beach Proximity and Access<br>•Just 200 yards to beach access with restrooms and free parking.<br>•Inlet Beach shoreline spans approximately 1 mile<br>•Lifeguard on duty during peak season and artificial reef available for snorkeling.<br>•Equipped with beach chairs, umbrella, cart, and beach toys for your convenience.<br>•Additional beach chairs and umbrellas can be rented at beach access during peak season.<br><br>Spacious Accommodation<br>•Sleeps up to 6 guests comfortably in beds.<br>•Primary Suite: Luxurious King Bed with ensuite and walk-in shower.<br>•Second Bedroom: Queen Bed with an additional Trundle Bed, featuring 2 twin beds.<br>•First floor powder room<br>•Smart TVs in every bedroom for your entertainment.<br><br>Cottage Features<br>•1300 sq.ft. of cozy living space just off highway 98.<br>•Fully stocked kitchen for all your cooking needs.<br>•High-speed internet access throughout the home.<br>•Private, fully-fenced backyard with dining area and umbrella for evening relaxation.<br><br>Additional Amenities<br>•Entire home features a water filtration system for purity and freshness.<br>•Provided beach towels for your comfort.<br>•Permanent baby gate installed on staircase.<br>•Private driveway with parking for 2 cars<br><br>Important House Rules<br>•Maximum of 6 guests. No more than 6 people allowed on the property at any time. No events allowed on property. <br>•No smoking, vaping, or any form of burning inside the home.<br>•Pets are not permitted to maintain allergen-free premises.<br>•Person booking must be on-site with all accompanying guests.<br>•Any damaged items or property issues are the responsibility of the primary guest.<br><br>Feel free to reach out anytime during your stay for any questions or assistance. We look forward to providing you with a personalized and unforgettable beach vacation experience!<br><br>By ensuring your comfort and convenience, we are committed to making your stay in our home an exceptional experience. Book your stay today and step into the charming coastal life of Inlet Beach.<br><br>Other things to note<br>•Only permitted animals are allowed on Walton county beaches. Permits are available to Walton County property owners or permanent residents only. Proof of Residency or Property Ownership is necessary to obtain a permit. Permitted dogs are allowed on County beaches between the times of 3:30pm and 8:30am 365 days a year. Beach compliance does patrol county beaches.",
